  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 200°C/180°C fan-forced.\n• Slice mini flourtortillas into quarters.\n• Finely chop red onion and capsicum.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Drain and rinse black beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot, onion and capsicum, stirring, until tender, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add black beans, garlic paste and All-American spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66e3a17ee6df74d078e467e8-8dd95930.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir in the butter, water and passata, until combined and slightly reduced, 1-2 minutes.\n• Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66e3a17ee6df74d078e467e8-ae73b342.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread tortilla pieces over a lined oven tray (don't worry if they overlap).\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.\n• Bake until lightly golden and crispy, 8-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66e3a17ee6df74d078e467e8-e379ee65.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide smokey black bean chilli between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over Cheddar cheese.\n• Top with light sour cream. Tear over coriander.\n• Serve with tortilla chips. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66e3a17ee6df74d078e467e8-efedaad1.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
